{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0524_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0c1eebb18353c4f605452a9be5bf2c2a8b2c7fd016ed0b315c674037c1977a30", "ja": "（育に誘われて、一緒に出かけることになった。\n買い物を終え、今は公園でゆっくりしている……）", "zh": "（受到育的邀请，要一起出门了。买完东西后，现在正在公园里悠闲地休息……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0524_1001_030iku", "source_sha256": "bd159840879e2c0d4db2b97051c7bd9e8b1f312d0afe2f5facba854257b17f9d", "ja": "もうこんな時間かぁ……。\n楽しい時間って、あっという間だね。", "zh": "都这个时间了啊……\n开心的时光，真的过得好快呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0524_1002_p", "source_sha256": "d7b1cc065f1b99ef3e5abb2482c5ca8d1a91dd6a4182c8556b2a1de57995e5f2", "ja": "そうだな。\n特に今日は、一日が早かった気がするよ。", "zh": "是啊。特别是今天，总觉得一天过得很快。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0524_1003_030iku", "source_sha256": "873fae96da1d3f302b668e4eea928cb81b2cbca87f068066be4960239ae2240f", "ja": "うん。{$P$}さんは、どうだった？\n今日一日、楽しかった？", "zh": "嗯。{$P$}先生觉得怎么样？\n今天一天，玩得开心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0524_1004_p", "source_sha256": "1f7defcba1c4fa91afc9500377f2f3f3cb6d0a907670168b7854450852bebf6a", "ja": "ああ、すごく楽しかったよ。\nそれに、いい息抜きにもなったな。", "zh": "嗯，特别开心。\n而且也好好放松了一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0524_1005_030iku", "source_sha256": "2bee5429456521c8f6ab4eee992655ce2fd06fab986d1478ba3b1438d9876724", "ja": "ほんとう！？　えへへ、よかった～。それじゃ、\nわたしの作戦、バッチリ大成功だったみたいだね♪", "zh": "真的！？嘿嘿，那太好了～。这么看来，我的作战计划大获成功啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0524_1006_p", "source_sha256": "223921f9bf0b0543ed858c95bad8f349c82e377ce9dae0e17aaf1c9a9ded02c0", "ja": "……作戦？", "zh": "……作战？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0524_1007_030iku", "source_sha256": "2ec2b2366f3d3ed1e558f0078a77dfa215a43efaad28832202ad48d3d939921d", "ja": "えっとね、{$P$}さん、\n最近ずっとお仕事で忙しそうだったでしょ？", "zh": "那个……{$P$}先生，你最近一直都因为工作忙得不可开交，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0524_1008_030iku", "source_sha256": "a84643123abdfdba509b5888d3da7f3fa3079748baea7ed3beca1e8d4c514b16", "ja": "それにお休みの日も、お仕事のこと考えてるって\n言ってたし……大丈夫かなぁって心配してたの。", "zh": "而且你还说过，就连休息日也一直在想着工作的事……我一直很担心你，怕你会不会没事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0524_1009_p", "source_sha256": "f37d60603f62ed78d837b828d3d00754e696256f2f4556884f62fa9aea02519d", "ja": "育……。", "zh": "育……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0524_1010_030iku", "source_sha256": "025c816b59eaa2cdde8346e8d7581cf0fe3f89d73f321a69be163eb2acbca6e3", "ja": "それでね、おかあさんに相談したら、\n「育が一緒にお休みを過ごしてあげたら？」って。", "zh": "所以呀，我去问了妈妈，她说：\n“要不让育陪你一起度过休息日？”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0524_1011_030iku", "source_sha256": "b143be11570a44e071233b80dfbe12969cd549624ef194f131db37f380e3af23", "ja": "わたしが一緒なら、お仕事のこと考えないと思って。\nだから『{$P$}さんお休み大作戦』！", "zh": "我想，只要有我陪着，就不会去想工作的事了。所以就是“{$P$}先生休息大作战”！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0524_1012_030iku", "source_sha256": "ece1a86927fe573a5551b7909e943c8640d952d423ac83e2c306cff9a4290c7b", "ja": "でも、お買い物に付き合わせちゃったし……。\nうう～、ごめんなさい。もっと疲れちゃったよね……。", "zh": "可是还让你陪我去买东西了……  \n呜呜～对不起。你肯定更累了吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0524_1013_p", "source_sha256": "20ec4c6fe95210ce106abb388a3fc639d1174d795a8296d1ae55dcdcc71ffbb6", "ja": "そんなことないよ。いい勉強になったからな。\nまたコスメのお仕事を育達に取ってくるのも……。", "zh": "没那回事。因为学到了不少东西。下次也给育她们接些化妆品相关的工作……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0524_1014_030iku", "source_sha256": "07a3b0818a88bede87253128cef57782de98410ac4dfe014a1ad4f665dd16ba2", "ja": "あーっ！　{$P$}さん、\nまたお仕事のこと、考えてる～！", "zh": "啊——！{$P$}先生，\n你又在考虑工作的事了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0524_1015_p", "source_sha256": "c19352422b1908ac0c84a982ae2320cf6c456386e8795acc77955707d3920ab8", "ja": "あっ……。", "zh": "啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0524_1016_030iku", "source_sha256": "713b53441c1db8543192dde263e50d8ed931e9d87aa34a18bb8eaa6149622577", "ja": "ダメだよ、{$P$}さん！\nお休みの日は、お仕事を忘れてゆっくりしないと！", "zh": "不行啦，{$P$}先生！\n休息日就要忘掉工作，好好放松才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0524_1017_p", "source_sha256": "1cc80c11ca2c63c5b4558e60750862105ce56ea61c86f6c31b9ab338e6709deb", "ja": "そうだな……。ごめんごめん、つい。", "zh": "是啊……抱歉抱歉，一不小心就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0524_1018_030iku", "source_sha256": "c17baf1037492c147ccda8d8f641d44a106119d6e7db719cdec99d3e9abd3593", "ja": "も～、やっぱり{$P$}さんは、\nわたしがちゃんと見てなくちゃ。", "zh": "真是的～果然{$P$}先生\n得由我好好看着才行呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0524_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0524_1019_030iku", "source_sha256": "c635b774263b574b9af43c293298285751daf042958659993c5724ff8380ab8d", "ja": "だからまた、今日みたいにお出かけしようね。\n次はもっともっと楽しいところに連れてってあげる！", "zh": "所以，下次也要像今天一样一起出去玩哦。\n下次我会带你去更加更加好玩的地方！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
